  "category": "free-field",
  "summary": "A 100 kg hemisphere of TNT on rigid ground. The incident (side-on) peak overpressure, positive impulse and arrival time at ground level from 0.75 to 6 m/kg^(1/3), against Kingery and Bulmash's fit for a hemispherical surface burst, the design-practice standard behind ConWep and UFC 3-340-02.",
